parts.text:
I need to get the following featuyre in hp348,

On NixOS, add this to your system configuration:

boot.kernelParams = [ "iomem=relaxed" ];

If you're using the normal /etc/nixos/configuration.nix, edit it:

sudo nano /etc/nixos/configuration.nix

Add the line somewhere inside the main { ... } block, for example:

{
  # ...

  boot.kernelParams = [ "iomem=relaxed" ];

  # ...
}

